  "steps": [
    "Explicit Play loads the bound WAV through the existing GET route and starts a real WebAudio source. Offline rendering of the actual decoded buffer/gain verifies nonzero PCM, declared volume and looping beyond the first source duration; Stop cleans up. No source or metadata write.",
    "At 390px in Chinese, English and Japanese, Stop remains visible, audition and current volume survive translation, and playback never changes the reviewed source proposal. Cancel discards the form without changing the ordinary draft or author files.",
    "Changing a form field and reloading the catalog stop active playback. Non-looping audio ends naturally. Closing during looped playback stops the source and closes AudioContext; no source changes occur."
  ],
